label "Mode 0, auto-wiki: people or agents write Markdown, lint gates check it (highlighted), a static site with search and a NOW page is built, and lessons and stale flags flow back to the writers"
caption "The highlighted gates are deterministic checks, so the wiki corrects itself without any model; what comes back is a proposal a person ratifies."
box write 16 90 110 50 "write Markdown|(people, agents)"
box lint 160 85 120 60 "lint gates|schema, links,|staleness" acc
box site 304 90 140 50 "static site|search, NOW, graph"
box lessons 160 180 120 44 "lessons +|stale flags"
arrow write lint
arrow lint site
arrow site lessons dashed
arrow lessons write dashed
note "no model needed: checks are deterministic lints; fixes return as proposals"
